# calibration/background .npz files and the notes.
lidar_recordings/
lidar/z4captures/**
!lidar/z4captures/*.npz
!lidar/z4captures/interlaced/
lidar/z4captures/interlaced/*
!lidar/z4captures/interlaced/perf_notes.md
*.log

